      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a phone that lets you message and call friends without them being in the same world would be awesome, and maybe world creators can choose if they let the phone work or not for like games. Would also be a great way to handle your gallery for pictures and to send them to friends.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
