      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Being able to do this by sending camera video (not re-rendering the caller’s world on the callee’s side) would be game-changing for allowing mobile users to have access to much larger worlds through their friends “bringing them along” on a call while exploring. Not only does this provide a way to keep cross platform groups together as they move from world-to-world, it also reduces barriers to participation without limiting content quality or scope. This would enhance and encourage social exploration, especially for very large or complex worlds, which is one of the things that sets VRChat above from other platforms.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
